{"shot_id": "G01-S02", "text": "啧……床真窄啊。", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G01-S02.wav", "seconds": 3.24, "elapsed": 3.26}
{"shot_id": "G01-S03", "text": "睡不着，根本睡不着……", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G01-S03.wav", "seconds": 2.87, "elapsed": 2.88}
{"shot_id": "G01-S04", "text": "您好，检测到您已经清醒，请问是否打开睡眠舱？", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G01-S04.wav", "seconds": 2.56, "elapsed": 2.59}
{"shot_id": "G01-S06", "text": "……是。", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G01-S06.wav", "seconds": 2.97, "elapsed": 3.0}
{"shot_id": "G01-S07", "text": "差点忘了，这里不用怕出声引来丧尸。", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G01-S07.wav", "seconds": 2.92, "elapsed": 2.93}
{"shot_id": "G02-S02", "text": "以天为被、地为席了十年，倒被这高级'棺材'憋醒了。", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G02-S02.wav", "seconds": 3.09, "elapsed": 3.12}
{"shot_id": "G02-S04", "text": "星际300年……地球？早炸没了。", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G02-S04.wav", "seconds": 2.9, "elapsed": 2.91}
{"shot_id": "G03-S01", "text": "末世摸爬滚打十年，好不容易快吃上国家饭——", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G03-S01.wav", "seconds": 2.79, "elapsed": 2.82}
{"shot_id": "G03-S02", "text": "结果被一只五级丧尸，舔了。", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G03-S02.wav", "seconds": 2.85, "elapsed": 2.88}
{"shot_id": "G03-S05", "text": "薇姐——！", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G03-S05.wav", "seconds": 2.54, "elapsed": 2.56}
{"shot_id": "G04-S02", "text": "关门！", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G04-S02.wav", "seconds": 2.77, "elapsed": 2.79}
{"shot_id": "G04-S06", "text": "上一秒……还在五金店等死。", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G04-S06.wav", "seconds": 2.68, "elapsed": 2.7}
{"shot_id": "G05-S02", "text": "新型育儿舱问世……可搭载超电磁加农炮的新型机甲试装成功……", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G05-S02.wav", "seconds": 2.57, "elapsed": 2.6}
{"shot_id": "G05-S03", "text": "四大发明？在这儿是考古。", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G05-S03.wav", "seconds": 2.54, "elapsed": 2.55}
{"shot_id": "G05-S04", "text": "星际150年，人类在机甲上的……", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G05-S04.wav", "seconds": 2.57, "elapsed": 2.59}
{"shot_id": "G05-S05", "text": "干净水随便喝，热水随便洗……舍不得再死一回了。", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G05-S05.wav", "seconds": 2.67, "elapsed": 2.7}
{"shot_id": "G06-S01", "text": "父母一周后回来，弟弟在集训——还有七天，够我摸清这个世界。", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G06-S01.wav", "seconds": 2.47, "elapsed": 2.48}
{"shot_id": "G06-S03", "text": "……这人谁？为什么赶都赶不走？", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G06-S03.wav", "seconds": 2.64, "elapsed": 2.65}
{"shot_id": "G06-S04", "text": "原身，十八岁，第一军校准新生——为了追这小子，命都差点练没了。", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G06-S04.wav", "seconds": 2.74, "elapsed": 2.77}
{"shot_id": "G07-S02", "text": "精神力超出体能，会溃散死亡；体能超出精神力，身体比脑子快……", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G07-S02.wav", "seconds": 2.44, "elapsed": 2.47}
{"shot_id": "G07-S03", "text": "原身练得太激进了……猝死，怕是跟这有关。", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G07-S03.wav", "seconds": 2.69, "elapsed": 2.7}
{"shot_id": "G07-S04", "text": "……饿了。", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G07-S04.wav", "seconds": 2.67, "elapsed": 2.68}
{"shot_id": "G08-S03", "text": "草莓、香蕉、青菜……还有鸡蛋！", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G08-S03.wav", "seconds": 2.51, "elapsed": 2.54}
{"shot_id": "G08-S04", "text": "这一顿搁基地，得半个月贡献点！", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G08-S04.wav", "seconds": 2.58, "elapsed": 2.59}
{"shot_id": "G09-S01", "text": "主人，请问有什么需要我做的吗？", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G09-S01.wav", "seconds": 2.78, "elapsed": 2.79}
{"shot_id": "G09-S03", "text": "……不用，我自己来就好。", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G09-S03.wav", "seconds": 2.82, "elapsed": 2.86}
{"shot_id": "G09-S04", "text": "好的，如果您有需要，请随时叫我。", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G09-S04.wav", "seconds": 2.62, "elapsed": 2.64}
{"shot_id": "G09-S06", "text": "别的都能忍。吃饭这件事——没挨过饿的人，没有发言权。", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G09-S06.wav", "seconds": 2.87, "elapsed": 2.9}
{"shot_id": "G11-S01", "text": "发根是黑的，发梢染白……为了学那个白毛。审美也太独特了。", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G11-S01.wav", "seconds": 2.58, "elapsed": 2.59}
{"shot_id": "G11-S02", "text": "娃娃脸，化浓妆，全包眼线，指甲涂得黑一块白一块……", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G11-S02.wav", "seconds": 3.43, "elapsed": 3.45}
{"shot_id": "G11-S03", "text": "放我们那会儿，管这叫——精神小妹。", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G11-S03.wav", "seconds": 3.07, "elapsed": 3.1}
{"shot_id": "G11-S04", "text": "不过是群孩子当面一套背后一套，把个小姑娘逼得用外壳武装自己。", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G11-S04.wav", "seconds": 3.01, "elapsed": 3.03}
{"shot_id": "G11-S05", "text": "人活着，可真不容易啊……", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G11-S05.wav", "seconds": 3.14, "elapsed": 3.17}
{"shot_id": "G12-S01", "text": "你？……", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G12-S01.wav", "seconds": 2.75, "elapsed": 2.76}
{"shot_id": "G12-S02", "text": "王天薇？大半夜不睡觉，在这干什么？", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G12-S02.wav", "seconds": 2.59, "elapsed": 2.62}
{"shot_id": "G12-S04", "text": "这个点儿你还没吃东西……饿成这样？", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G12-S04.wav", "seconds": 2.53, "elapsed": 2.54}
{"shot_id": "G12-S05", "text": "呃……", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G12-S05.wav", "seconds": 2.47, "elapsed": 2.48}
{"shot_id": "G13-S01", "text": "原来你现在长这样啊……", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G13-S01.wav", "seconds": 2.42, "elapsed": 2.43}
{"shot_id": "G13-S02", "text": "……你怎么这个时候回来了？", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G13-S02.wav", "seconds": 2.82, "elapsed": 2.83}
{"shot_id": "G13-S04", "text": "集训半夜结束？", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G13-S04.wav", "seconds": 2.64, "elapsed": 2.65}
{"shot_id": "G13-S05", "text": "第一军校的集训，什么时候结束都有可能。谁完成了谁提前出来呗。", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G13-S05.wav", "seconds": 2.72, "elapsed": 2.73}
{"shot_id": "G14-S01", "text": "这样啊……那你早点休息，我也先回去睡了。", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G14-S01.wav", "seconds": 2.62, "elapsed": 2.63}
{"shot_id": "G14-S02", "text": "哦。", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G14-S02.wav", "seconds": 2.61, "elapsed": 2.62}
{"shot_id": "G14-S05", "text": "今天竟然没有刺我？……是还没睡醒吗？", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G14-S05.wav", "seconds": 2.53, "elapsed": 2.56}
{"shot_id": "G06-S05", "text": "都星际时代了，还有恋爱脑？！", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G06-S05.wav", "seconds": 25.93, "elapsed": 25.95}
{"shot_id": "G13-S03", "text": "S班的集训结束了。晚上回来和明早回来，没什么不一样。", "speed": 1.6, "status": "ok", "wav": "C:\\Users\\lincu\\Documents\\ai_short_drama.agent\\pipeline\\animatic\\voice\\G13-S03.wav", "seconds": 3.54, "elapsed": 3.55}
